WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.164
Video 24. Office network: ghana PC, chopda ek
j.

00:00:06.364 --> 00:00:11.411
Ek PC chopda raakhe chhe. Aa PC office server
chhe.

00:00:11.341 --> 00:00:15.629
Beeja PC e j chopda Chrome ke Edge ma khole
chhe.

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:20.189
Darek vyakti potana naam ane password thi log
in kare chhe.

00:00:20.389 --> 00:00:28.422
Server PC par, Windows ni Hisaab app ma: F1,
Settings, Data Folder and Server.

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:35.945
"Other computers in the office open these
books" ne Yes karo. Port 9100 chhe.

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:40.012
Eni neeche, beeja PC maatenu address dekhaay
chhe.

00:00:40.212 --> 00:00:49.024
Ctrl+A thi save thaay chhe. Windows ek vaar
firewall rule maate puchhe chhe. Yes kaho.

00:00:48.954 --> 00:00:54.763
Windows rule na umere, to Hisaab IT vyakti
maate ek command bataave chhe.

00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:58.237
Pachhi Hisaab office server tarike fari sharu
thaay chhe.

00:00:58.537 --> 00:01:02.914
Logo ni neeche, server PC have OFFICE SERVER
bataave chhe.

00:01:02.944 --> 00:01:08.425
F1, S, F thi Data Folder and Server khule
chhe.

00:01:09.505 --> 00:01:13.787
Ema address, ane certificate ni fingerprint
dekhaay chhe.

00:01:15.555 --> 00:01:26.095
Pachhi darek vyakti maate user. Alt+K, Security: Control
User Access, Yes, ane maalik no password.

00:01:26.794 --> 00:01:34.866
Alt+C thi user bane chhe: Data Entry, naam,
ane Allow Browser Access, Yes.

00:01:35.817 --> 00:01:40.062
Pachhi user no password. Have priya list ma
chhe.

00:01:42.694 --> 00:01:49.626
Beeja PC par, Chrome ke Edge kholo: https,
server nu address, ane port.

00:01:49.656 --> 00:01:57.999
Pehli vaar, Hisaab server ni fingerprint bataave chhe.
Server PC saathe sarkhaavo, pachhi aagal vadho.

00:01:58.029 --> 00:02:03.653
Company pasand karo, ane tamara potana naam
ane password thi log in karo.

00:02:06.342 --> 00:02:13.031
Have priya e j chopda par kaam kare chhe. Aa
PC MULTI USER bataave chhe.

00:02:13.511 --> 00:02:19.450
Ek PC chopda raakhe chhe, ane office nu darek
PC ena par kaam kare chhe.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:23.275
Have pachhi: screen ni bhaasha ane phonetic
typing.

